Border Hunters is a action, thriller film directed by Ruben Islas.

3
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:21,000
After his police officer brother is killed by a drug dealer who flees to the protection of his cartel-connected uncle in
Mexico, an American man with a diverse law enforcement/military background goes south of the border to get revenge

